      "content": "The anguish of your past is festering, and the temptation of revenge is seductive, offering a semblance of redemption through bloodshed. The weight of your own downfall has convinced you that only the sacrifice of others can bring you solace, and that the most unforgiving absolution lies in the steel of your sword. In this mindset, the boundaries between soldier, commander, and perpetrator begin to blur, as the two collide into a monolithic figure driven solely by a thirst for revenge.",
